# ==============================================================================
# Head Kidney Granuloma - 5. Module Scoring and Raincloud Visualization
# ==============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Calculate module scores for functional gene programs in the integrated
#   head kidney spatial transcriptomics dataset and visualize these scores
#   across annotated spatial domains.
#
# Required input:
#   seu_int_rpca:
#     Integrated and annotated Seurat object generated by:
#       01_HK_ST_Control_Infected_RPCA_Integration.R
#       02_HK_ST_Integrated_Domain_Annotation.R
#
# Main outputs generated in memory:
#   module_score_mapping
#   module_score_plots
#
# Notes:
#   This script does not save figures to disk. Users can export plots as needed.
# ==============================================================================


